WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.334
♪♪

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:05.701
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:09.501
President Biden is facing
criticism after he fist-bumped

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:12.067
Saudi Crown Prince
Mohammed bin Salman

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.734
last week during their
first in-person meeting.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.801
Of course, at this point,
that's like saying

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:18.801
"Mosquitos are
facing criticism."

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:19.801
When weren't they?

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:21.167
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:24.100
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
apologized last week,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.601
after she said that
the Latino community is, quote,

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:30.434
"as unique as the breakfast
tacos here in San Antonio."

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:31.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.567
Said Biden in her apology,
"I'm as sorry

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.968
as the breakfast tacos
at Taco Bell."

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:39.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:41.667
Former President Trump and
former Vice President

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.300
Mike Pence are set to hold
competing rallies on Friday

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.033
in Arizona.
It will be the first time

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.534
they've faced off
since January 6th.

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.868
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:53.400
Jennifer Lopez and Ben Affleck
over the weekend

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.801
reportedly got married.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.534
Guests were offered beef,
chicken,

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:58.667
or bacon, egg, and cheese.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.734
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.968
I felt really good
about that joke earlier.

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.067
You know what,
it's for a certain --

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.167
it's for a certain region
of America.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:11.701
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:13.567
Hope you enjoy it, New England!

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:17.601
That's right, Ben Affleck
and Jennifer Lopez

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:20.033
reportedly got married over
the weekend, because right now,

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.868
that's the only way a Red Sox
fan can get a win in the Bronx.

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:23.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:25.701
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:29.167
Wow. I took it right --
I took it right back.

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:31.400
Told a joke for New England
that bombed in New York,

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.400
And then [bleep] 'em
with the next joke.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:40.834
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz
announced recently

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:44.334
that the coffee chain will close
16 stores due to rising crime.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:46.000
The most egregious crime?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.868
Waiting until you're
at the front of the line

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:49.300
before looking at the menu.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:57.834
"Oh, so the sizes
are in Italian."

00:01:57.834 --> 00:02:01.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.567
The fast food restaurant Subway
recently changed the names

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:06.868
of several of its sandwiches,
including switching

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:09.133
the meatball marinara
to "The Boss,"

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:11.801
as opposed to what's usually
called "the boss" at Subway --

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:13.534
a 16-year-old kid.

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:15.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:18.133
Lego recently announced
that they will release

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:20.701
a new set based on the sitcom
"The Office."

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:24.133
Though, if your kid wants that,
bad news, they're a Dwight.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:27.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.868 --> 00:02:30.434
And finally, producers have
announced that a reboot

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:32.701
of the procedural
"Criminal Minds" will air

00:02:32.701 --> 00:02:35.167
on the streaming service
Paramount+.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:37.234
So if you're a big fan of
detective work,

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:40.033
try and figure out how to watch
Paramount+.

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:42.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.200
According to a new report,
some of President Biden's

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.167
top allies are quietly meeting

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.501
with Democratic officials
and donors

00:02:49.501 --> 00:02:52.467
ahead of the 2024 election
in case he doesn't run.

00:02:52.467 --> 00:02:54.801
Well, quietly,
aside from the person

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:57.100
who keeps coughing the word
"Hillary."

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:01.467
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
met today with

00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:03.601
Ukrainian First Lady
Olena Zelenska

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.200
at the White House.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.601
"Sorry for everything your
country is going through,"

00:03:07.601 --> 00:03:09.133
said Zelenska.

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:12.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:14.434
Elon Musk was photographed
over the weekend

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:16.734
aboard a luxury yacht
in Mykonos, Greece,

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:19.100
and all I can say is wow!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.334
He is...

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:24.801
He is so white,
the sun had to put on sunscreen!

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:26.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:29.400
He looks like
the page in the coloring book

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.534
you haven't gotten to yet.

00:03:31.534 --> 00:03:32.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:36.234
Is he partying on that yacht...

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:37.734
or is he haunting it?

00:03:37.734 --> 00:03:39.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:41.367
I will say, though --
I will say, he does have

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:44.901
the skin tone of somebody who
is very good with technology.

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:46.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:49.868
Steven Spielberg recently
directed his first music video

00:03:49.868 --> 00:03:51.901
using his smartphone,
which is surprising

00:03:51.901 --> 00:03:55.801
because most people his age
record concerts on their iPads.

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:57.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.601 --> 00:03:59.534
In a new interview,
a couple who has been married

00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:01.901
for nearly 80 years
said that their secret

00:04:01.901 --> 00:04:03.367
to a long-lasting relationship

00:04:03.367 --> 00:04:06.067
is always sharing a kiss
before bedtime.

00:04:06.067 --> 00:04:09.033
"Same," said those freaks
from "Willy Wonka."

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.801
New York Governor Kathy Hochul
announced yesterday

00:04:14.801 --> 00:04:17.434
she will expand
shark-patrol crews

00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:20.801
amid an increase
of attacks on Long Island.

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:23.400
Meanwhile, Republican governors
are encouraging residents

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.634
to buy sharks for protection.

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:29.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.033 --> 00:04:32.467
The only thing
that stops a shark

00:04:32.467 --> 00:04:34.534
is a good guy with a shark.

00:04:34.534 --> 00:04:36.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.501 --> 00:04:40.801
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:04:40.801 --> 00:04:42.367
11% of Americans said that

00:04:42.367 --> 00:04:44.300
their favorite ice-cream flavor
is vanilla.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.300
Well, if you love vanilla,
I got good news for you!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.534
There it is!
That was a monologue, you guys.

00:04:49.534 --> 00:04:52.901
The White House is reportedly
considering major changes

00:04:52.901 --> 00:04:54.801
for its communications team.

00:04:54.801 --> 00:04:57.033
For example,
they're going to get one.

00:04:57.033 --> 00:04:58.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.934 --> 00:05:02.400
The National Archives yesterday
asked the Secret Service

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.534
to provide information
about the deletion

00:05:04.534 --> 00:05:06.167
of agents' text messages

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:08.000
pertaining
to the Capitol attack.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.267
Who's laughing now...

00:05:09.267 --> 00:05:11.133
said the one agent
with an Android

00:05:11.133 --> 00:05:12.734
who wasn't allowed
in the group chat.

00:05:12.734 --> 00:05:14.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.501 --> 00:05:17.434
Britain's Prince William
and Duchess Kate Middleton

00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:18.634
announced today

00:05:18.634 --> 00:05:20.467
that they will travel to Boston
later this year.

00:05:20.467 --> 00:05:23.734
This news was first reported
by Paul Revere.

00:05:23.734 --> 00:05:27.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:28.834
Former New York mayor
Bill de Blasio

00:05:28.834 --> 00:05:31.367
announced yesterday he's ending
his congressional campaign,

00:05:31.367 --> 00:05:33.934
and I'm guessing this is
not how Bill de Blasio

00:05:33.934 --> 00:05:37.801
wanted everyone to learn
he had a congressional campaign.

00:05:37.801 --> 00:05:39.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.734 --> 00:05:42.200
Today was
National Pennsylvania Day.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.467
"Where the hell is that?"
asked Dr. Oz.

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:47.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.534 --> 00:05:50.868
According to a new list, Vermont
is the best state to live in.

00:05:50.868 --> 00:05:53.501
Well, no wonder.
He always looks so happy.

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:55.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.601
Netflix reported yesterday

00:05:56.601 --> 00:05:59.033
that it lost nearly
1 million subscribers

00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:00.567
in the last three months.

00:06:00.567 --> 00:06:03.534
Well, Netflix, I think you
finally have your answer.

00:06:03.534 --> 00:06:05.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.734 --> 00:06:08.200
Two governing bodies
of quidditch have announced

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:11.067
that they will change the name
of the sport to quadball

00:06:11.067 --> 00:06:13.801
in an effort to distance
themselves from J.K. Rowling.

00:06:13.801 --> 00:06:15.334
Said bullies, "Fine,

00:06:15.334 --> 00:06:18.367
let's go beat up
the quadball players, then!"

00:06:18.367 --> 00:06:19.467
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:21.968
When asked about his song
"American Pie"

00:06:21.968 --> 00:06:24.133
in a new documentary,
singer Don McLean

00:06:24.133 --> 00:06:27.834
said the jester mentioned in
the lyrics is not James Dean.

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:29.667
He also said, "Please,

00:06:29.667 --> 00:06:31.901
please don't sing that song
at karaoke."

00:06:31.901 --> 00:06:33.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.167 --> 00:06:35.501
And finally,
after a man recently fell

00:06:35.501 --> 00:06:37.434
and injured himself
at Lake Tahoe,

00:06:37.434 --> 00:06:39.067
his border collie ran 200 yards

00:06:39.067 --> 00:06:41.167
through the remote area
of the forest

00:06:41.167 --> 00:06:43.200
to lead rescue crews
to his owner,

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:47.200
while his French bulldog ran
six feet and immediately died.

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:51.501
President Biden tested positive
today for the coronavirus.

00:06:51.501 --> 00:06:54.334
Luckily, we've all been
keeping our distance.

00:06:54.334 --> 00:06:56.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:56.334 --> 00:06:59.033
That's right, President Biden
tested positive today

00:06:59.033 --> 00:07:00.467
for the coronavirus.

00:07:00.467 --> 00:07:02.801
So, for the next two weeks,
the country will be hosted

00:07:02.801 --> 00:07:04.300
by Chelsea Handler!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.300
[ Laughter ]

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.300
She'll do great.
She's a pro.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.300
According to a poll
released yesterday,

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:13.234
President Biden's approval
rating has hit a record low 31%,

00:07:13.234 --> 00:07:15.067
putting him below the critical

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:17.234
"yellow Starburst" benchmark.

00:07:17.234 --> 00:07:19.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.234
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:07:22.234 --> 00:07:23.868
help a prime-time hearing
tonight

00:07:23.868 --> 00:07:27.300
and offered a timeline of what
former President Trump did

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.467
at the White House
during the insurrection.

00:07:29.467 --> 00:07:31.267
We tape early,
but I'm guessing...

00:07:31.267 --> 00:07:32.934
watched TV?

00:07:32.934 --> 00:07:34.167
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:36.434
That's like finding out
what Joey Chestnut did

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:37.601
on Fourth of July.

00:07:37.601 --> 00:07:40.934
Same thing that he always does.

00:07:40.934 --> 00:07:43.434
Former Vice President Mike Pence
spoke yesterday

00:07:43.434 --> 00:07:46.267
at a South Carolina church
and said that the best part

00:07:46.267 --> 00:07:47.934
of no longer being in office

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.033
is that he gets to drive
his own car,

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:51.534
and he made it very clear

00:07:51.534 --> 00:07:53.033
that he drives an automatic

00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:55.367
because it's a sin
to drive stick.

00:07:55.367 --> 00:07:58.033
[ Laughter ]

00:08:01.601 --> 00:08:03.601
His words, not ours.
I mean...

00:08:05.067 --> 00:08:08.067
Authorities in Spain this week
arrested two thieves

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:11.400
who allegedly stole
45 bottles of wine from a hotel

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.901
that were worth
nearly $2 million.

00:08:13.901 --> 00:08:15.567
Even worse, they stole

00:08:15.567 --> 00:08:17.234
the Toblerone from the minibar,

00:08:17.234 --> 00:08:19.067
valued at $3 million.

00:08:19.067 --> 00:08:20.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.367 --> 00:08:25.200
And finally, the Mega Millions
lottery jackpot

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:29.200
hit $630 million this week
after there were no winners.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.767
Whoever wins it this week
can take the jackpot

00:08:31.767 --> 00:08:34.100
in installments,
a lump sum,

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.100
or premium unleaded.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.934
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:39.934
Ohh! [ Laughs ]

00:08:39.934 --> 00:08:42.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:42.267 --> 00:08:44.634
That was a monologue, everybody.

